# Grilka, Widowed Warrior: "gain control of target creature an opponent controls until end of turn. Untap it. Until end of
# turn, it gains trample, haste, and 'Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, create that many tapped
# Treasure tokens.'" Bot1 casts Grilka and takes Bot2's Llanowar Elves (CR 613.1b): the Elf is untapped, has haste, so it
# attacks Bot2 the turn it changed hands (CR 302.6, 702.10). The granted ability sees that 1 damage (CR 510.2, 603.2c) and
# Bot1, the ability's controller, creates one tapped Treasure (CR 109.5). Bot2's Ornithopter is the other creature an
# opponent controls offered and passed up (CR 115.1) - tapped by its own attack, so it cannot block the Elf - and Grilka
# herself is no target an opponent controls.

